From 230db53fd658de727740ea7faa7a1e3df273bd01 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Utah Packages <utah-packages@projectbluefin.io>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 04:49:30 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Limit the workspace to the plugins this recipe builds

The recipe builds rtp, gif, hlssink3, dav1d and spotify, the plugins
freedesktop-sdk enables, from a vendor/ tree of checksum-pinned
crates.io crates. Cargo resolves every workspace member, so the full
workspace needs all 1116 locked crates, including the git-only ffv1 and
flavors crates the vendored source cannot carry. Keep only those five
plugins and version-helper as members and let cargo prune Cargo.lock:
485 packages remain, no version or checksum changes, no git sources.
---
 Cargo.lock | 8706 +---------------------------------------------------
 Cargo.toml |  113 -
 2 files changed, 103 insertions(+), 8716 deletions(-)

